# Pairs with TenantRuleConfinement. Without the admin check any caller, an
# outsider included, authors a tenant-tier rule through the facade.
MODULE: FacadePutRuleSkipsAdminCheck
TARGET: TenantRuleConfinement
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the tenant policy facade writes a tenant rule without authorizing the caller
PERTURBS: FacadePutRule

--- FIND
       /\ IF ~auth THEN Refuse("putRule", auth, fl, "denied", FALSE)
--- REPLACE
       /\ IF FALSE THEN Refuse("putRule", auth, fl, "denied", FALSE)
--- END
